      "source": [
        "# **DL Assignment 1**\n",
        "\n",
        "Implement a simple feedforward neural network from scratch in Python without using any in-built deep learning libraries. This implementation will focus on basic components like forward pass, backward propagation (back-propagation), and training using gradient descent.\n",
        "Display teh values of all weigths updated in each Epochs\n",
        "\n",
        "# **Import Libraries**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kaE1I5jt0Vo2"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ORrLIFMZ0Whz"
      },
      "execution_count": 2,
      "outputs": []
    },
